{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"share","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent22AsyncBroadcastSequenceV","text":"AsyncBroadcastSequence","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncBroadcastSequence"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"return-value","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Return Value"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"An ","type":"text"},{"code":"AsyncBroadcastSequence","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" that multicasts elements to multiple consumers concurrently.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"This operator is an alias for ","type":"text"},{"code":"broadcast()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", providing identical behavior.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"It enables multicasting of values from the upstream sequence to multiple"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"concurrent consumers without duplicating upstream work. A consumer receives"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the elements the shared sequence reads from the upstream after the consumer"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"creates its iterator; elements already read and handed out are not replayed."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Example","text":"Example","level":2},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["\/\/ Create an AsyncStream that emits 3 random values between 1 and 5","let upstream = AsyncStream<Int> { continuation in","    continuation.yield(Int.random(in: 1...5))","    continuation.yield(Int.random(in: 1...5))","    continuation.yield(Int.random(in: 1...5))","    continuation.finish()","}","","let sharedSequence = upstream.share()","","async let firstConsumer = Task {","    for await value in sharedSequence {","        print(\"First consumer received \\(value)\")","    }","    \/\/ prints the values the shared sequence reads after this consumer subscribed","}","","async let secondConsumer = Task {","    for await value in sharedSequence {","        print(\"Second consumer received \\(value)\")","    }","    \/\/ prints the values the shared sequence reads after this consumer subscribed","}","","\/\/ A consumer that subscribes after the shared sequence has handed out values misses them.","await firstConsumer.value","await secondConsumer.value"]}]}],"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences\/AnyAsyncSequence\/share()","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"share","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent22AsyncBroadcastSequenceV","text":"AsyncBroadcastSequence","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"title":"share()","externalID":"s:Sci7Afluents8SendableRzsAB7ElementRpzrlE5shareAA22AsyncBroadcastSequenceVyxGyF::SYNTHESIZED::s:7Afluent14AsyncSequencesO03AnyB8SequenceV","role":"symbol","symbolKind":"method","modules":[{"name":"Afluent","relatedModules":["_Concurrency"]}],"conformance":{"constraints":[{"code":"Self","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" conforms to ","type":"text"},{"code":"Sendable","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"Element","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" conforms to ","type":"text"},{"code":"Sendable","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"availabilityPrefix":[{"text":"Available when","type":"text"}],"conformancePrefix":[{"text":"Conform